NAVIGATION NOTE
  The shell route host (.admin) is a single slot previously held directly by DiskForecast.
  To add a second admin page WITHOUT regressing DiskForecast reachability, this introduces the
  "admin sub-router" that DiskForecast/ApiPlayground registrations explicitly anticipated:
  AdminSectionView lists the implemented admin pages and pushes each via a value-based
  .navigationDestination(for: AdminDestination.self). DiskForecastPage source is unchanged.

